m_id\": \"FT-5\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Submitted review for Sakura Garden with 5-star rating, name (Test Reviewer), visit date (Jan 15, 2024), and review text. Received confirmation \\\"Review Submitted! Thank you for sharing your experience.\\\" Review count increased from 1 to 2. New review now displays in Reviews tab with all submitted details: rating shown as 5 stars, name, date, and review text: \\\"Excellent dining experience. The food was delicious and the service was impeccable. Highly recommended!\\\"\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-6\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Entered coupon code \\\"WELCOME10\\\" and clicked Apply. Received notification \\\"Coupon Applied! 10% off your first reservation\\\". Coupon section now displays applied coupon \\\"WELCOME10\\\" with discount \\\"- 10% off\\\" and an X button to remove it. Discount offer is clearly visible to user before completing reservation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-7\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When opening the date picker for Aug 27 (today), dates 1-26 were disabled/unavailable (past), but dates 27-31 were enabled (future). Successfully selected future date Aug 27 and combined it with available times (17:00, 17:30, 18:00, 18:30, 19:00, 19:30, 20:00, 20:30, 21:00).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-8\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Clicked Modify on Sakura Garden reservation. Dialog appeared with options to change Time and Party Size (date option not presented in UI). Changed time from 18:00 to 19:30 and party size from 2 to 4 Guests. Clicked Save Changes and received confirmation \\\"Reservation Updated - Your reservation has been modified successfully.\\\" Reservation list immediately reflected changes: time now shows 19:30 and party size shows 4 Guests.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Review submission allowed without completed reservation. Application accepted review for Sakura Garden despite user having only a future reservation (Aug 30, 2026) which is not yet completed.\", \"actual\": \"System allowed review submission for restaurant with only future/upcoming reservation. Expected behavior: reviews should only be allowed for restaurants with past/completed reservations.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Coupon eligibility constraints not enforced. WELCOME10 coupon (marked for first reservation) was applied successfully even though user already has existing reservations (Sakura Garden upcoming, The Golden Fork cancelled).\", \"actual\": \"Application accepted WELCOME10 coupon application without checking first-reservation eligibility constraint. Coupon text says \\\"10% off your first reservation\\\" but was allowed on what appears to be a second/subsequent reservation attempt.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Reservation form clearly marks required fields with asterisk: Name *, Email *, Phone *, Date, Time. When attempting to submit reservation without filling these fields, form did not proceed to confirmation, indicating required field validation is in place. Form fields have placeholder text explaining expected format (e.g., email@example.com, +1 (555) 000-0000).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"When clicking Cancel on Sakura Garden reservation, a confirmation dialog appeared with message \\\"Cancel Reservation? This action cannot be undone. Your reservation at Sakura Garden will be cancelled.\\\" with two buttons: \\\"Keep Reservation\\\" and \\\"Cancel Reservation\\\". Cancellation only proceeded after explicit confirmation.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Created reservation: received immediate notification \\\"Reservation Confirmed!\\\" with details. Modified reservation: received immediate notification \\\"Reservation Updated - Your reservation has been modified successfully\\\" and reservation list updated in same session without reload. Cancelled reservation: received immediate notification \\\"Reservation Cancelled\\\" and Upcoming/Past tabs updated instantly showing 0/1 count change.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"My Reservations page has tabs distinguishing \\\"Upcoming (1)\\\" from \\\"Past (1)\\\". Upcoming shows Sakura Garden with status \\\"Upcoming\\\", date Aug 30 2026, time 19:30, party size 4 Guests, location Arts District, with Modify/Cancel buttons. Past shows The Golden Fork with status \\\"Cancelled\\\", date Aug 27 2026, time 19:00, party size 2 Guests, location Downtown. All reservation details consistently displayed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-17\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Rating inconsistency between restaurant list and detail page. Sakura Garden showed rating 4.6 on restaurant list view but 5.0 on detail page, inconsistent with CT-17 requirement for consistent ratings.\", \"actual\": \"Sakura Garden displays 4.6 rating on restaurant list but 5.0 rating on restaurant detail page. Expected: same rating displayed in both views. Review count was consistent (1, then 2 after review submission) but overall rating shows inconsistency.\", \"evidence\": null}]}"
